  "body": "I keep thinking that blue text here \r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8614563/173848033-cb053ccd-35f5-457c-953b-1d717a3d8a02.png)\r\n\r\nis a hyperlink or some kind of drop down menu that will let me navigate between older spec versions. It's not. I would love to see us [make it so](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FaLyasJPyUU).\r\n\r\nFor inspiration, see the drop-down selector in the top left of [docs.python.org](https://docs.python.org/3/)",
